Z||000002||PlasticWrapd||11-27-2000||10:05 PM||||Clean the injectors, get a new o2 sensor.  A bad o2 sensor dropped the mpg in my 4 banger from 30 to 18-20.  Exhaust was loaded with unburned fuel.  ||||reg||1
